Black smoke, no grilled meat;
Black squid, no lobster;
Black chalkboard, no chalk;
Black dust, hidden in drawers;
Black today, no tomorrow;
Black tears, no joy;
All black things, go away quickly!

Take a pen,
最好是圆珠笔,
Draw a beautiful circle on white paper.
Take a colored pen,
最好是黄色的,
Fill my circle with color.
Look, it became a ball.
I colored faster and faster,
Drawing circles inside the circle.
In the end, it became the sun,
Lighting up the world!
